{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01506-s03","batch":1506,"shard":3,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":60,"shard_end_exclusive":80,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:4c7ecc0a25c32be8f9a7650e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"有通知来了哦。\r\n不去确认一下吗？","source_fingerprint":"9118b4c63de6396f5828d1de3c6a0d1c69b77ac785ddeb11f95d3ea92b6d0b64","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10015"],"target_text":"Có thông báo mới đấy.\r\nAnh không đi kiểm tra sao?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:44f6f5a48097abb872c6da08","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好像有礼物送来。\r\n……给你的。","source_fingerprint":"261c24e02c71492404bd77add1771b9531e91f8c87d2f88ee2b67fcc2b85e93e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10016"],"target_text":"Hình như có quà được gửi tới.\r\n…Cho anh đấy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:81a567f34551975599e94720","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"任务完成，辛苦了。\r\n那么开始进行下一个课题吧。","source_fingerprint":"2873bab410cbd1d3f785a1acbfb969319fa5e7a0686a417fa3a4727233583cf0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10017"],"target_text":"Nhiệm vụ hoàn thành, anh vất vả rồi.\r\nVậy bắt đầu bài tiếp theo thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:43e504543e2d93f2c8fb12e9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"活动的公告已经发出来了呢。\r\n……如果您感兴趣的话，请去吧。\r\n我就……不必了。","source_fingerprint":"0a6b55a0edf7751d25b74647a941897d5f093da61d882d4b37e1229d39c2fd9d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10018"],"target_text":"Thông báo sự kiện đã được đăng rồi.\r\n…Nếu anh hứng thú thì cứ đi nhé.\r\nCòn tôi… không cần đâu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:acde02af9ab8998c3f0d8dda","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"活动已经开始了。\r\n您去参加一下比较好吧。","source_fingerprint":"8fddaa9a027275474ed5851a9b4b401efb70f4e89fbf7c002d96c5bdf44b2410","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10019"],"target_text":"Sự kiện đã bắt đầu rồi.\r\nAnh nên đi tham gia thì hơn.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":65,"uid":"zhcn:1d96302292e86b5c6d829e76","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"为什么……！","source_fingerprint":"c4acd8823111dabf049aa21daa7d3d761b3fe48ec0e1304a8c87ccc9d87d50f9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1002"],"target_text":"Tại sao…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:d7a2a801ed8319ef0b44c5db","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"名鉴等级似乎提升了。","source_fingerprint":"9fa58b8d9d676ccdff6f319a973a696a186cfc24e60d1b2b6c0b0b1c0e4c058b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10021"],"target_text":"Có vẻ Cấp Danh bạ đã tăng.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:d75f21c163f063347762fd24","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……选衣服的时候\r\n不会上来搭话的店。我只在\r\n那种地方买衣服。","source_fingerprint":"ae11752d32d32563b16e31f8edab93adcbe9dce29c4cb203135d3f2a9758e663","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10025"],"target_text":"…Những cửa hàng mà khi chọn đồ\r\nnhân viên sẽ không tới bắt chuyện. Tôi chỉ\r\nmua quần áo ở những nơi như thế.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:3570775f25fe44c733048ca9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"被转手售出的饰品。……去古着店，\n偶尔就是为了寻找这种\n有韵味的东西。","source_fingerprint":"b3571c3b3eee3892c41fc9e321090a632ddc5eb76acadedb0544cf2d327a35bf","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10026"],"target_text":"Những món phụ kiện đã qua tay người khác. …Đôi khi tôi tới cửa hàng đồ cũ\nchỉ để tìm những món\ncó nét duyên như thế.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:526ac1ec6f7231ee690b3aac","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……衣服的，洗涤标签。\r\n很扎人……\r\n要是能消失就好了……","source_fingerprint":"32828abad1a4915d6d7efd52da9d594b4cffdf0b338a35cbbaae9e0a2303cd51","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","10027"],"target_text":"…Nhãn giặt trên quần áo.\r\nCọ vào người khó chịu quá…\r\nGiá mà nó biến mất được thì tốt…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":70,"uid":"zhcn:57a785735483ea6dbf34e84f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"没有下一次了。","source_fingerprint":"5de0dacff5d810f60e98fefe143f3120cf6ec5d188ef6b2fb4b175c07db03f82","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1003"],"target_text":"Sẽ không có lần sau đâu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":71,"uid":"zhcn:44b305ff3d363729ba731cf7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我不会得意忘形的。","source_fingerprint":"111ddaf1a9558f3b490cf979826a4193888264f543062360387df83de5dbea46","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1004"],"target_text":"Tôi sẽ không vì đắc ý mà mất tự chủ đâu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":72,"uid":"zhcn:ab0c6d51256314a360d29ea5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"为什么……！","source_fingerprint":"c4acd8823111dabf049aa21daa7d3d761b3fe48ec0e1304a8c87ccc9d87d50f9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1005"],"target_text":"Tại sao…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":73,"uid":"zhcn:419b12015628394bc20e731b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"没有下一次了。","source_fingerprint":"5de0dacff5d810f60e98fefe143f3120cf6ec5d188ef6b2fb4b175c07db03f82","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1006"],"target_text":"Sẽ không có lần sau đâu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":74,"uid":"zhcn:21aa257a13db8d881f3fe4b0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"最高分更新了，是吗。","source_fingerprint":"4e3cb244a13ca36fed6e860859dc13a60dbdcfd604f791c90b9b6267bf29f51c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1007"],"target_text":"Kỷ lục điểm cao nhất đã được cập nhật, phải không.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":75,"uid":"zhcn:4fff5c985e7a9e6b9ee506c9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"请多关照……","source_fingerprint":"76e546beb607c78391a13a35fae42de155540fc89abd524192b761dd1d1f1747","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","1008"],"target_text":"Mong anh giúp đỡ…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":76,"uid":"zhcn:30aed8b8b43e5e2efe45d1d9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"Cygames","source_fingerprint":"70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","11"],"target_text":"Cygames","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":77,"uid":"zhcn:9cc363272b180e0126a7791b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"是来找我商量训练的事吗？\r\n……请长话短说。","source_fingerprint":"ab522987fb5b6bedf31d3d042dc08f24aca4a485714128d301a3239084537db8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","110000"],"target_text":"Anh đến tìm tôi để bàn chuyện tập luyện sao?\r\n…Xin hãy nói ngắn gọn.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":78,"uid":"zhcn:cba5696e8e2cacd605280486","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……我对别人的故事不感兴趣。\r\n不过，历史还是有学习价值的","source_fingerprint":"868b874b8b1f1d9f020622a1a3e4585f20278567490d81d306d8b0438379198f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","110001"],"target_text":"…Tôi không hứng thú với chuyện của người khác.\r\nNhưng lịch sử thì vẫn đáng để học.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":79,"uid":"zhcn:008f514bb71ba01169789e7b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"赛事吗。\r\n……那么，我要去赢下它。","source_fingerprint":"1cfa8bc79703968c5867894695c7cb7cf5f532ab6bee2b6d93427a633ec2e8ac","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","110002"],"target_text":"Một cuộc đua sao.\r\n…Vậy tôi sẽ đi giành chiến thắng.","reviewed":true}]}